+  /* Horizon (Switch): allow embedders to shrink the per-thread stack.
+   * 8 MB x 4 threads is a desktop default; on a memory-constrained
+   * console (applet mode grants the process ~380 MiB total) committing
+   * 32 MiB of thread stacks at first use can fail outright -> abort().
+   * UV_THREADPOOL_STACK_SIZE is in bytes; uv_thread_create_ex() rounds
